{"version":1,"content":"<p>遊戲開發者大會（GDC）近日發佈的《2026年11月遊戲行業現狀》調查報告顯示，生成式人工智能（AI）在遊戲行業內部依然引發顯著分歧。該調查覆蓋了超過2600名來自不同職能部門的遊戲行業從業者，內容涉及行業裁員現狀、離職後重新就業率以及行業未來走向等議題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586342.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.990018+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:34:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"6a1e40f3c81963ea2b1e1e351d7f48d80736576a79f3708674889d90ba71a950","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}